# R26: Narrator lines for Moonfall (region moonfall: mf_round, the eight Old Fears' regions and the last hill). The Narrator is the Vagrant, telling the tale afterwards: second
# person, present tense, one or two sentences, no game words. The moon is bigger every night, and the humour is the kind a village keeps when it has nothing else left.
# No {name} or {target} in a plain line (those are not voiced). Written by hand; unvoiced until the voice thread records them.

~ enter:mf_round
| The Round is a camp now, tents in the lee of the clocktower and a fire where the founder's statue stood. The moon fills so much of the sky that the fire seems to be asking its pardon.
| The Ghostlight Express stands steaming at a platform that was never here, and somebody has hung washing from its handrail.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_covered_bridge
| Foxwillow's fields lie under a moon too big for them, and the corn leans one way, toward the river. The covered bridge waits at the end of the track with its mouth open.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_moonsong_rift
| Moonsong Lake lies flat as a plate. At the water's edge the nets hang from every post, and nothing in the shallows is quite the right shade of white.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_tall_man_palace
| The forest has healed and every tree in it is leaning, politely, the same way. Somewhere under the green a grey palace is waiting for you to be afraid.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_howlers_peaks
| The mountains are white and silent, which is worse than if they were loud. The rune stones along the path are older than any name you could put to them.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_barrow_catacombs
| The graves lie open under the moon like a row of doors, and the earth beside each is heaped as neatly as a housemaid would. A black stair leads down.
| The air by the barrow is the temperature of a held breath.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_jinxed_bayou
| The bayou smells of old luck gone sour. Every third plank of the boardwalk looks fine and none of them is.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_webwoods
| Webs hang across the path like washing lines, and the trees stand close the way folk do at a funeral. A white thread is tied to every shutter of the homestead.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_dusk_mother_hut
| From outside it was a hut. Inside it is a hall, and the hall is full of dolls, and every one of them has turned to look at you.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_rowans_volcano
| Rowan's Rise has burst, and the sky above it is the colour of a coal. Burning stones fall in the leisurely way of things that know they will land.
cooldown 30

~ enter:mf_last_hill
| The hill is bare and the moon hangs over it like a low ceiling, its face so near you can see the cracks in its teeth. Somewhere below, a roof lets go and goes up to meet it.
cooldown 30
